---
/**
 * The fixed layers behind the content, plus the scroll-progress bar: the paper wash and
 * rose bloom shared with the other pages, the emerald-ramp ground with its two very slow
 * drifts, and the rule grid that reads `--gridY` from the page script.
 */
---

<div class="paper" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="rose" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="ground" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="drift a"></span>
  <span class="drift b"></span>
</div>
<div class="grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div class="prog"></div>
